    "description": "Security, GDPR, SOC 2, and external trust resources.",
    "markdown": "# Trust and Compliance\n\nLast Updated: June 9, 2026\n\n## SOC 2\n\nCoCalc by SageMath, Inc. is **[SOC 2 compliant](https://www.vanta.com/collection/soc-2/what-is-soc-2)**, meaning we meet rigorous standards for data security and operational integrity. This compliance is verified through independent audits, ensuring that we effectively protect customer information across security, availability, processing integrity, confidentiality, and privacy. Our commitment to these high standards enhances trust and reliability for our users.\n\n**Please learn more about the current status in [SageMath, Inc.'s Trust Center](https://trust.cocalc.ai/).**\n\n![SOC 2 Compliance Logo](/public/soc2-aicpa-logo.png)\n\n## GDPR\n\nSageMath, Inc. compliance with [GDPR](https://gdpr-info.eu/) has been verified by our EU and UK representative [GDPR Local](https://gdprlocal.com/).\n\n## Questions?\n\nPlease contact us at [office@sagemath.com](mailto:office@sagemath.com) if you have any questions.\n",
